---

<aside class="verseguide-credit">
  <div class="verseguide-credit__header">
    <span class="verseguide-credit__logo" aria-hidden="true">🚀</span>
    <h3 class="verseguide-credit__title">Content Enhanced</h3>
  </div>
  
  <p class="verseguide-credit__description">
    This guide is enhanced with <a href="https://verseguide.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="verseguide-credit__link">VerseGuide</a>, 
    providing detailed location data, coordinates, and navigation information throughout the Star Citizen universe.
  </p>

  <div class="verseguide-credit__features">
    <div class="verseguide-credit__feature">
      <span class="verseguide-credit__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">📍</span>
      <span class="verseguide-credit__feature-text">Precise coordinates</span>
    </div>
    <div class="verseguide-credit__feature">
      <span class="verseguide-credit__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
      <span class="verseguide-credit__feature-text">Optimized flight paths</span>
    </div>
    <div class="verseguide-credit__feature">
      <span class="verseguide-credit__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">📸</span>
      <span class="verseguide-credit__feature-text">Location photography</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="verseguide-credit__disclaimer">
    VerseGuide is an unofficial Star Citizen resource. All location images and coordinates are provided for reference purposes.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .verseguide-credit {
    background: var(--color-neutral-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    margin: var(--space-8) 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }

  .verseguide-credit__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .verseguide-credit__logo {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .verseguide-credit__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-heading-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-wide);
  }

  .verseguide-credit__description {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  .verseguide-credit__link {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-primary-600);
    transition: all var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .verseguide-credit__link:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-700);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-primary-700);
  }

  .verseguide-credit__features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .verseguide-credit__feature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
  }

  .verseguide-credit__feature-icon {
    font-size: 1.1em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .verseguide-credit__disclaimer {
    font-size: var(--text-body-xs);
    color: var(--color-neutral-500);
    line-height: var(--line-height-snug);
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-200);
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* Mobile adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .verseguide-credit__features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
